## Pause Points

The Orchestrator pauses and waits for human input at these points:

### 1. UX Discovery (Track A only)
**When:** Before Product/UX Lead creates spec
**Why:** Human interview required to understand needs
**What to do:** Answer UX Lead's discovery questions

### 2. Plan Approval (Track A, B)
**When:** After Dev writes implementation plan
**Why:** Validate approach before coding starts
**What to do:** Review plan, approve or request changes

### 3. UAT (Track A, B)
**When:** After Dev implements, before Architect code review
**Why:** Ensure implementation meets user needs
**What to do:** Test the feature using the manual testing checklist

### 4. Merge Approval (All tracks)
**When:** After all reviews pass
**Why:** Final human approval before merge
**What to do:** Review PR summary, approve merge

