## Artifacts

What gets passed between roles:

| From | To | Artifact | Format |
|------|-----|----------|--------|
| Product/UX Lead | Dev | Spec | File path (e.g., `docs/specs/FEATURE.md`) |
| Dev | Architect (plan) | Plan | File path (e.g., `.planning/feature/PLAN.md`) |
| Dev | Architect (code) | PR | PR number only |
| Product/UX Lead | Architect | Spec | File path only |

**Critical:** When passing to Architect, include ONLY:
- File paths
- PR/Issue numbers
- CI status

**Do NOT include:**
- Dev's reasoning
- Planning discussions
- "Why" behind choices

